WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
[Instrumental music]
Like your friend’s Blackboard? Take it.

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:04.500
Copy theme code. Theme code copied.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:07.000
[Message pops]
Share the code in a study-group chat.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Paste the code. Preview the changes and font downloads.
Use this theme. Theme applied.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.800
Pass the look on again.

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:22.000
Three screens. Three Blackboards. One look.
Your whole look is one line of text.
